---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import DecorativeStar from '../components/DecorativeStar.astro';import PostCard from '../components/PostCard.astro';import {snapshot,posts,pathTo} from '../lib/snapshot';import {categories,categoryDescriptions} from '../lib/defaults';
const homePosts=[...posts].sort((a,b)=>Number(!!b.featured)-Number(!!a.featured));
---
<Layout><section class="hero container"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="small-dot"></span> A LITTLE SPACE ON THE INTERNET</span><h1>记录日常，<br>也记录<span class="accent">生长。</span></h1><p class="hero-description">{snapshot.settings.description}</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href={pathTo('posts/')}>开始阅读 <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={pathTo('about/')}>认识一下我 <span>→</span></a></div><div class="hero-note"><span class="note-line"></span> 不急着抵达，先把沿途记下来。</div></div><div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="art-grid"></div><div class="art-circle"></div><div class="notebook"><div class="notebook-top">FIELD NOTES <span>01 / ∞</span></div><div class="notebook-title">生活的注脚</div><div class="notebook-lines"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="notebook-bottom">日常 · 研究 · 视频</div></div><div class="art-label">COLLECT MOMENTS,<br>KEEP GROWING.</div><DecorativeStar class="art-star" /></div></section><section class="category-band"><div class="container">{categories.map((name,index)=><a href={pathTo(`posts/?category=${encodeURIComponent(name)}`)}><span class="category-num">0{index+1}</span><span>{name}</span><span class="category-caption">{categoryDescriptions[name]}</span><span>↗</span></a>)}</div></section><section class="container section-space"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">LATEST NOTES</span><h2>最近写下的</h2></div><a class="text-link" href={pathTo('posts/')}>全部文章 <span>→</span></a></div>{posts.length?<div class="post-grid">{homePosts.slice(0,6).map(post=><PostCard post={post}/>)}</div>:<div class="empty-state"><span class="empty-symbol">✎</span><h3>第一篇，正在路上。</h3><p>这里会放下学习中的发现、生活中的小事，<br>还有那些值得再想一想的瞬间。</p><a class="text-link" href={pathTo('about/')}>先从认识我开始 →</a></div>}</section><section class="container closing-card"><div><span class="eyebrow">SAY HELLO</span><h2>如果有共鸣，<br>就留下一句话。</h2><p>想法、建议，或只是打个招呼，都欢迎。</p></div><a class="button light" href={pathTo('guestbook/')}>去留言板 <span>↗</span></a></section></Layout>
